@startuml
' 报告用图 4：借书顺序图（窄版 5 条生命线，专为 A4 排版）
' 取自 specs/10-sequence-borrow-book.puml，把 4 个 Repository 合并为"领域对象与仓储"一条生命线
' 完整版（9 条生命线，含全部分支）见 specs/10-sequence-borrow-book.puml 与 docs/uml/10-sequence-borrow-book.png
' 渲染：java -DGRAPHVIZ_DOT=... -jar tools/plantuml.jar -o <abs> docs/report-figures/src/04-sequence-borrow.puml

skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam BoxPadding 8

actor "图书管理员" as Librarian
participant "BorrowController" as Ctrl
participant "Circulation\nApplicationService" as AppSvc
participant "Circulation\nService" as Domain
participant "领域对象\n与仓储" as Repo

Librarian -> Ctrl : 刷借阅证 + 扫条码
Ctrl -> Ctrl : 校验角色 = LIBRARIAN
Ctrl -> AppSvc : borrow(cardNo, barcode, operatorId)
AppSvc -> Domain : borrow(...)

group ① 验证借阅证（UC-901）
  Domain -> Repo : findByCardNo
  Repo --> Domain : BorrowCard
  alt 证不存在 / 状态非 ACTIVE / 已过期
    Domain --> AppSvc : BusinessException(CARD_*)
    AppSvc --> Ctrl : 异常冒泡
    Ctrl --> Librarian : 400 / 403 + 提示
  end
end

group ② 额度与 ③ 超期（UC-902）
  Domain -> Repo : findBorrowPolicy(readerType)
  Domain -> Repo : countActiveLoans / findOverdueLoans
  alt 超过额度 或 存在超期
    Domain --> AppSvc : BusinessException(QUOTA_* / OVERDUE_*)
  end
end

group ④ 校验副本
  Domain -> Repo : findByBarcode
  alt 副本状态非 AVAILABLE
    Domain --> AppSvc : BusinessException(ITEM_NOT_AVAILABLE)
  end
end

group ⑤ 写入
  Domain -> Domain : dueDate = borrowDate + loanPeriod
  Domain -> Repo : save(Loan)
  Domain -> Repo : item.status = ON_LOAN
  Domain --> AppSvc : Loan
end

AppSvc --> Ctrl : BorrowResponse(dueDate)
Ctrl --> Librarian : 201 + 应还日期

@enduml
